16. ACCURACY OBJECTIVE

When a manually validated report is supplied, calculate accuracy against it using the same validation scope and row correspondence.

Accuracy must be calculated as:

Accuracy % =
(Number of rows where Automated Overall Result = Manual Overall Result)
/
(Number of comparable validation rows)
× 100

Do NOT compare unrelated row numbers.

Do NOT penalize the automated report for rows that were outside the manual validation scope.

Do NOT create artificial mismatches by comparing different row populations.

If the automated validation reproduces every manual validation decision:

Accuracy = 100%

